==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*peh₂w-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|fewe}}, from {{inh|en|ang|fēaw|t=few}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*fau}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*fawaz|t=few}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*peh₂w-||few, small}}.

Cognate with {{cog|osx|fā||few}}, {{cog|goh|fao}}, {{m|goh|fō|t=few, little}}, {{cog|non|fár|t=few}}, {{cog|got|𐍆𐌰𐌿𐍃|t=few}}, {{cog|la|paucus|t=little, few}} (whence English {{m|en|pauper}}, {{m|en|poor}} etc.). More at {{l|en|poor}}.

